config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_498_VELAMECANUM
	bool "Contest 2026 team 498 VelaMecanum formation control"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable the contest 2026 team 498 VelaMecanum formation control
		demo.  The on-device entry reports the formation capability set;
		missions are issued through the ai_agent formation_control tool
		and executed by the four MentorPi M1 vehicles.